  "definition": "Living with a Specified Relative",
  "effectiveDate": "2012-03-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6446, eff 2-1-97; amd by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8050, eff 3-1-04; ss by #10077, eff 3-1-12",
